  "title": "Filter Core",
  "description": "Dependency-free filter model for Dethink filter surfaces: a serializable AND/OR filter tree with negation; typed text, number, date, boolean, option and multi-option operators; relative dates stored relative and resolved per time zone as calendar days (DST-safe); custom field types and operators; group commands with a shared depth limit; validation; a compiled row predicate; facet, impact and empty-result rescue counts; a TanStack adapter; readable sentences and membership-aware diffs.",
